WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:03.610
Start with a small problem: help someone
find a fictional

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:07.530
community resource. Keep the first app to
one page with

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:12.830
search, a category filter, and readable
results. Write three checks

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:16.430
before asking AI to build anything, so you
can tell

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.290
whether the result actually works.

00:00:20.161 --> 00:00:25.001
HTML gives the page its content and
structure. CSS controls

00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:29.281
appearance and layout. JavaScript responds
to input, such as filtering

00:00:29.281 --> 00:00:33.081
a list. The supplied starter keeps
fictional records inside the

00:00:33.081 --> 00:00:37.601
file. It has no real account system,
private database, or payment service.

00:00:39.427 --> 00:00:42.767
Tell the AI what the user should do, which
controls

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:46.327
are needed, and how to test them. Ask for
labeled

00:00:46.327 --> 00:00:52.147
fields, visible keyboard focus, and no
external dependencies. Use

00:00:52.147 --> 00:00:56.667
fictional data. Do not place passwords or
private API keys

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:59.667
in browser code, because people can
inspect that code.

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:05.209
Run the checks yourself. Try a matching
name, a search

00:01:05.209 --> 00:01:09.209
with no results, and different letter
cases. Use only the

00:01:09.209 --> 00:01:13.669
keyboard, then narrow the screen. Record
what you expected and

00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:18.129
what actually happened. A confident AI
statement does not count

00:01:18.129 --> 00:01:20.029
as evidence that these paths work.

00:01:21.726 --> 00:01:25.766
Save a first version, request or make one
small improvement,

00:01:26.266 --> 00:01:30.406
and repeat the affected test. Also repeat
a test that

00:01:30.406 --> 00:01:34.366
already passed to catch a new problem. If
no AI

00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:38.166
tool is available, edit the starter's
heading and a fictional

00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:43.466
resource in a plain-text editor. Keep both
versions and your test log.
